  },
  "description": [
   "JRC2018UnisexVNC is a 3D template of the ventral nerve cord (VNC) of the adult fruit fly Drosophila melanogaster. This template was created by combining confocal microscopy images of multiple male and female flies, resulting in a unisex template that includes the neuropils and all motor and sensory neurons."
  ],
